HakiOS / Redmi K20 Pro source

This tree is based on HeliumStudio-Dev/hackios-xnu-kernel. Original
copyright and license notices are retained. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.

Included:
- kernel/: selected Apple XNU 8796.121.2 sources and HakiOS adaptations.
  Apple's APSL 2.0 and individual third-party file notices apply.
- kernel/bsd/miscfs/apfs/libdeflate/: Eric Biggers / Google, MIT; see COPYING.
- kernel/bsd/miscfs/apfs/libzbitmap/ and tools/lzbitmap/: Corellium LLC,
  libzbitmap decompression, used under the offered MIT option; see COPYING.
- xnu-deps/hostinc/: Apple open-source Mach-O headers; retained file notices.
- wifi/lx/ and tools/mesa/: compatibility layers, patches and build tools;
  retain individual notices. Downloaded dependencies keep their own licenses.

Bluetooth source provenance:
- kernel/bsd/dev/hakios.raphael-bt.c adapts vayu_bt.c from
  nomorecoolnicknames/hakios-sm8150 at
  3e7be137a100cef19f1d7e83346b6e688be697d1. No license grant was found in
  that source repository or file. Its presence here does not grant a new
  license to the upstream author's work. The root project license does not
  assign MIT or APSL terms to this component by assumption.

Not included: Apple system images or SDKs, fonts, device firmware, firmware
arrays, private NV/calibration, third-party IPA files, device logs or identity.
The generated RMTFS scratch reservation contains zeroes, not device data.
